window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a land where peace has reigned for centuries, Queen Johanna finds herself unexpectedly thrust into power after the centuries-old curse on her bloodline is broken. Haunted by loss and unprepared for her royal duties, she's determined to reclaim her island's former glory, but shadows of chaos linger. Samuel, the head of her guard and a self-proclaimed woman-hater, is drawn to the vulnerable queen despite his fears. As they navigate their blossoming connection amidst a brewing storm, an unseen enemy threatens to shatter their fragile world. Can Johanna and Samuel forge a future together while protecting Westerly from its darkest secrets, or will tragedy strike once more?</p>"; 
